# task-maker: CrewCut Screenplay-rich and Synopsis tracks - Caminandes 3 sample

Everything here is produced by model calls (records in `annotations/caminandes3/rich_log.jsonl`) and scripts; no model text was edited by hand.
Run order (each script is a command; the checks that must pass are named):

| step | command | check |
| --- | --- | --- |
| hash | `scripts/verify_phash.py caminandes3 <master>` | `checks/phash_verification_caminandes3.txt` (bit agreement 0.9996, >= 0.99 required) |
| 1 film tables | `scripts/s1_film.py` | cross-check rows in `rich_crosscheck.jsonl`, resolutions in `rich_resolutions.jsonl` |
| 2,5,6 shot details | `scripts/s2_detail.py`, then `scripts/s2b_repair.py` (format fix) | same files |
| 6 sentence corrections, 3 synopses | `scripts/s3_fix_syn.py` | `description_corrections.jsonl`, `synopses.json` (with flags) |
| 4 reference images | `scripts/s4_images.py` | `references/caminandes3/manifest.json` (pHash vs all 6 films incl. mirror, vision check, request bodies hashed in `requests/`) |
| package | `scripts/s5_package.py` (no model calls; run twice gives identical bytes: tree sha256 `2ce8a19b...`) | `scripts/s6_check.py` -> `checks/package_checks.json`, exits non-zero on failure (1148 checks, 0 failed) |
| cost | `scripts/s7_cost.py`, `scripts/s7b_breakdown.py` | `cost/ledger.csv`, `cost/summary.json` |
| review | `scripts/s8_review.py` | `review/shot_NN.jpg` (frames + description + verdicts; not in any package) |

Models: draft `gemini-4-argon` (temperature 0, reasoning_effort low, max_tokens 16000), check `qwen3.5-plus` / `qwen3.5-omni-plus` (temperature 0, max_tokens 4000; the model's own thinking tokens are billed), images `gemini-3.1-flash-image` (exists in the model list; no fallback used).
Decisions and judgments: `decisions.md`. Open questions and the cost overrun: `questions_for_maintainer.md`.
Delivered: `annotations/caminandes3/`, `references/caminandes3/`, `packages/` (12 new + 6 updated `-scr`, `-ref` README only, `packages/UPDATES.json`), `tasks/dev_new_tracks.jsonl`, `review/`, `cost/`, `checks/`.
`references/caminandes3/` also keeps rejected attempts and request bodies (audit evidence). It is not part of any package.
Known gaps: the auditor's own re-checks and its look at 20% of the shots are not done here; the draft/check calls of the first (killed) synopsis run and a duplicate second process (shots 0-12, drafted twice with different continuity input) are in the log and the ledger, so the sample total (cost/summary.json) is slightly above a clean rerun.
